NAME
    gcloud compute zone-vm-extension-policies - compute Engine zone VM
        extension policies

SYNOPSIS
    gcloud compute zone-vm-extension-policies COMMAND [GCLOUD_WIDE_FLAG ...]

DESCRIPTION
    Compute Engine zone VM extension policies.

GCLOUD WIDE FLAGS
    These flags are available to all commands: --help.

    Run $ gcloud help for details.

COMMANDS
    COMMAND is one of the following:

     create
        Create a Compute Engine zone VM extension policy.

     delete
        Delete a Compute Engine zone VM extension policy.

     describe
        Describe a Compute Engine zone VM extension policy.

     list
        List Compute Engine zone VM extension policies.

     update
        Update a Compute Engine zone VM extension policy.

NOTES
    These variants are also available:

        $ gcloud alpha compute zone-vm-extension-policies

        $ gcloud beta compute zone-vm-extension-policies

